<title>UK: Rolls-Royce Cooper Rolls JV in $150 mln order.</title>
<headline>Rolls-Royce Cooper Rolls JV in $150 mln order.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>British engineering and aerospace group Rolls-Royce Plc said on Tuesday its Cooper Rolls joint venture with U.S. group Cooper Cameron Corp had won orders worth more than $150 million for gas turbines.</p>
<p>Rolls-Royce said the 15 Coberra turbine packages would be installed in gas transmission and offshore gas installations in the U.S., Canada, Slovakia and the North Sea.  </p>
<p>Rolls-Royce said the Northern Border Pipeline Company had ordered 11 of the units which were scheduled for delivery in autumn.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
